          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan suni ch'ufa ira hamtu nami d'iiratifi ka uwaleeni fulla waaqoota d'ara iti kad'atani suni huji sharmut'a hojatani, worri Yuda waan fafa hamtu, ka worri AABBO Waaqi duri worra Israeli duraa gusse tolfatu ch'ufa tolfate.",
          "type": "text",
