              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamuuni due jennaani fulla hayyoota iti awaalani dira Daudi keesati isa awaalani, jennaani ilmi isaa Abiyaani fulla isaa hayyu tahe.",
          "type": "text",
